<title>USA: Danville, Va., won by Scott &amp; Stringfellow.</title>
<headline>Danville, Va., won by Scott &amp; Stringfellow.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scott &amp; Stringfellow said it won $6.550 million of Danville, Va., general improvement bonds, 1996-1997, with a true interest cost of 5.2401 percent.</p>
</text>
